# Disclose every recorded gap

Disclose every gap, limitation, known failure or open decision written
into docs or a commit message in the same turn, including helper findings.
Describe what the user experiences and whether the
fix is in scope; otherwise say what separate work or decision it needs. Report
only concrete problems or material blockers; absent test records and routine
release timing are not gaps. See
[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#complete-and-verify-the-assigned-work).
